PATCH 285: a per-object ANIMATION-METHOD dispatch FUN_0000_ad08 -- DGROUP near-offset base-loss +
dropped object arg (SIGSEGV), dispatched by ab03; twin of ab88 (patch 282) with the vector table at
DGROUP:0x9820.

ASM-verified (asm 0xad08-0xad10; DS=DGROUP=0x1c00): di=object near offset in param_1; `movzx bx,
byte[di+0x43]; call [bx-0x67e0]` selects word[DG:(0x9820+byte[di+0x43])] and calls it with DI live.
